ctory to keep running! Pick letters from the pile, make the gifts, and wrap them up! Upgrade your equipment and find your own way to run the factory.💤 They only work together when it’s time to slack off. Can you make them a real team? Bring those work-shy gnome","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-17T07:25:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706683997","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:26:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4447620-1843481262699716","game_id":"steam-4447620","kind":"announcement","title":"The Gnomes Are Clocking In — Demo Coming This September!","summary":"The Demo Is Coming to Steam This September!Hello, we’re Tiny Workers!We’re excited to share that the Get to Work, Gnomes! Christmas Factory demo is planned to launch on Steam this September!Since our July playtest, we’ve been busy polishing up the Christmas factory as we work toward releasing the demo this September. A huge thank you to everyone who joined us for the playtest! Today, we’d like to give you a little preview of what you can expect on your next shift.Gnomes Learning on the JobGnomes","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-13T15:33:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262699716","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:26:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4447620-1836506165556122","game_id":"steam-4447620","kind":"announcement","title":"Steam Playtest is Live Now! : 06.27~06.30(PDT)","summary":"Hello everyone!The Steam Playtest for Get to Work, Gnomes! Christmas Factory is now live.This is a chaotic Christmas factory management game where lazy gnomes keep slacking off. Your job is to catch them, throw them back to work, and keep the gift production line running.Playtest Period June 27–30 PDTIn this Playtest, you can:Catch lazy gnomes before they waste too much timeThrow gnomes where they are neededProduce and package Christmas giftsUpgrade your factory workflowTest improved animations ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-27T09:33:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165556122","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:26:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4447620-1831432155570382","game_id":"steam-4447620","kind":"announcement","title":"Public Playtest Now Open!","summary":"Hello, Santa!Welcome to the Christmas gift factory.This is the first public playtest for Get to Work, Gnomes! Christmas Factory.The playtest is scheduled to run until May 4, 2026, at 11:59 PM PDT.Please note that the factory is currently in a trial run, so you may encounter bugs, inconveniences, or unexpected issues during play.Also, future updates may change, improve, or add new factory visuals, systems, and content.If you run into any issues or have any thoughts while playing, please feel free","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-01T05:58:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1831432155570382","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:26:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4447620":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:30:01Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:30:01Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4447620":"2026-10-26T12:30:01Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4447620":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:30:01Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:30:01Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:30:01Z"},"4555250":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:30:01Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:30:01Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:30:01Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4447620","app_id":4447620,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:37Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"adca78f8fc203bc468044d5b90e41eb3c10e7b4632fa24bf9ea09c4f373c298b","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"제멋대로인 노움들과 함께 크리스마스 선물 공장을 운영해 보세요!\r\n\r\nGet to Works, Gnomes! Christmas Factory는 크리스마스까지 아이들에게 전할 선물을 준비하는 짧은 운영 게임입니다. 선물을 직접 포장하고, 생산 설비를 마련하고, 노움들을 관리하며, 업무를 지시해 어수선한 공장을 점점 더 원활하게 개선해 나가세요.","publishers":[{"name":"Tiny Workers","creator_clan_account_id":46051898}],"developers":[{"name":"Tiny Workers","creator_clan_account_id":46051898}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1797253200,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_full"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Main Trailer","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1792911723","trailer_category":1,"microtrailer":[{"filename":"4447620/906668830/314032ed6153c250abe1df5880f93e7782421cb0/1788244379/microtrailer.webm","type":"video/webm"},{"filename":"4447620/906668830/314032ed6153c250abe1df5880f93e7782421cb0/1788244379/microtrailer.mp4","type":"video/mp4"}],"adaptive_trailers":[{"cdn_path":"4447620/906668830/314032ed6153c250abe1df5880f93e7782421cb0/1788244379/dash_av1.mpd","encoding":"dash_av1"},{"cdn_path":"4447620/906668830/314032ed6153c250abe1df5880f93e7782421cb0/1788244379/dash_h264.mpd","encoding":"dash_h264"},{"cdn_path":"4447620/906668830/314032ed6153c250abe1df5880f93e7782421cb0/1788244379/hls_264_master.m3u8","encoding":"hls_h264"}],"screenshot_medium":"257301419/d04be6bc95310f6bbd185a478ba12c221e072d41/movie_600x337.jpg","screenshot_full":"257301419/d04be6bc95310f6bbd185a478ba12c221e072d41/movie_full.jpg","trailer